    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5ca0c3a8-efc6-5866-9cdb-fde0d52b70d6" activityNameId="3ed45e9e-d683-5da9-8699-9b4fc724c268" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer system, PVC pipe, DN 600, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer system, PVC pipe, DN 600, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 84d98af2-c79c-42d7-8599-f621fb8dcd21
This process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with PP-HM pipe, DN 600, SN 4-8, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with PVC-pipe.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Complete sewer system, DN 600, SN 4-8, profile 4 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. PVC-pipe, ID 586-590 mm, outer diameter 630 mm, wall thickness 18-22 mm, 32-58 kg/m, 910-1400 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_84d98af2-c79c-42d7-8599-f621fb8dcd21.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
